 " steps, and decode its evolution with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["DecodeCyclicTagToNaryCyclicTag"]], 
    "paclet:EricJamesParfitt/CyclicTagCompiler/ref/\
